# Neon Postgres connection string. Used by `dbmate` and `lib/db.ts`.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host:5432/shiplog?sslmode=require

# GitHub PAT with read:user, repo, read:org scopes.
GITHUB_API_TOKEN=ghp_xxx

# Optional: override the date the daily collector targets (YYYY-MM-DD). Defaults to UTC yesterday.
# COLLECT_DATE=2026-05-07
